$ bun test ./tests
bun test v1.3.9 (cf6cdbbb)

tests/haptic-manufacturer-connections.test.ts:
(pass) haptic application manufacturer requirements > TI SOT-23 supply, ground, enable and output retain their physical pin numbers [57.04ms]
(pass) haptic application manufacturer requirements > AOS G/S/D and MDD cathode/anode close the intended flyback loop and retain default-off paths [0.40ms]

tests/type-c-manufacturer-connections.test.ts:
(pass) Type-C controller manufacturer requirements > UFP strap, GPIO mode and local supply prevent conflicting Rd and rail backpower [1.45ms]
(pass) Type-C controller manufacturer requirements > higher current requires stable controller power and advertised 1.5A or 3A [0.46ms]
(pass) Type-C controller manufacturer requirements > VBUS detection resistors meet TI's 855k–920k allowed range [0.87ms]

tests/motor-solder-access.test.ts:
(pass) motor connector is removed while two accessible solder pads retain the motor circuit [10.06ms]

tests/current-board-manufacturer-connections.test.ts:
(pass) current MCU USB, supply, reset and boot use Espressif physical pins [2.54ms]
(pass) current MCU external capacitors match Espressif's 22uF and 100nF reference values [0.70ms]
(pass) current charger and battery supervisor retain manufacturer power and control pins [4.53ms]
(pass) current regulator retains TI power, ground, feedback and switching pin identities [1.49ms]
(pass) current amplifier supply and differential speaker outputs retain manufacturer pin assignments [1.32ms]
(pass) current dual microphone power, data, clocks and channel select retain TDK pins [1.43ms]

tests/display-manufacturer-connections.test.ts:
(pass) display manufacturer physical pin requirements > LDO power/enable and buffer direction, output-enable and power use TI pin numbers [0.64ms]
(pass) display manufacturer physical pin requirements > buffer channel B pins match the manufacturer's LCD contact order and polarity [0.53ms]
(pass) display manufacturer physical pin requirements > unused buffer inputs are grounded and unused outputs, TE and LDO NC remain open [1.02ms]

